    "abstract": "<jats:p>Raimundo Soto of Pontificia Universidad Catolica de Chile reviews \u201cThe Chile Project: The Story of the Chicago Boys and the Downfall of Neoliberalism\u201d by Sebastian Edwards. The Econlit abstract of this book begins: \u201cExplores the rise and fall of the neoliberal model installed by US-influenced economists in Chile during the dictatorship of Augusto Pinochet, highlighting the persistent inequality and struggle for income and wealth distribution underlying the Chilean model's success.\u201d</jats:p>",
